      "id": "ex-coordinate-plane-distribution-and-its-affine-leaves",
      "concern": "The Example says “Its integral manifolds are the affine coordinate k-planes.” Under def-integral-manifold-of-a-distribution, every connected open proper subset of one such affine plane, with its inclusion, is also an integral manifold. The affine planes are the maximal leaves, not all integral manifolds.",
      "severity": "would-be-fatal"
    },
    {
      "id": "ex-kernel-of-a-submersion-as-an-integrable-distribution",
