    },
    {
      "id": "lem-transport-characteristics-depend-c-one-on-initial-position",
      "concern": "The proof fixes xi and obtains convergence of difference quotients there, but does not establish continuity in xi of the resulting Jacobian Y(t,xi), which is needed for the stated C^1 conclusion. Standard parameter-dependent ODE estimates supply it, but the written proof stops short.",
